menu "Metal Gear Solid (mgs_reversing + psyz)"

    config MGS_ENGINE
        bool "Build the Metal Gear Solid native port"
        default y
        help
            Compile the decompiled game (components/mgs/mgs_reversing) against
            psyz's PlayStation SDK reimplementation and software GPU, with the
            Tab5 platform layer in components/mgs/src.

    config MGS_START_STAGE
        string "Stage to boot into"
        default "s00a"
        help
            s00a is the dock, where the game begins; s01a the heliport; s02a
            the tank hangar. Any name in port/stage_union.c's
            Mgs_PlayableStages works. "title" runs the real boot chain, which
            needs the memory card and CD streaming the port lacks.

endmenu
